# The integration smoke set: the tests every scoped run includes, whatever
# changed (scripts/integ-select.py; SCOPE=smoke runs these alone). One name a
# line, as `func TestX` names it; # starts a comment. It is the core of what
# a person does, end to end against real stores, chosen to finish in about
# ten minutes in one slot. The full suite still runs for every release and
# once a day; this set never replaces it.

# Migrations at start-up: every migration applies to an empty database.
TestSmoke

# Sign-in and sessions
TestSignInSaysWhyAndPasswordsCanBeOff
TestRefreshTokensAreTradedOnceAndCopiesEndTheSession
TestDemotingAnAdminRefusesTheirNextRequest
TestExternalPeopleSignInOnlyByJoining
TestAnUpdateKeepsEveryoneSignedIn

# Access rules: docs, projects and tasks, tables, channels, search, live topics
TestDocAccessRules
TestDocAbilitiesMatrix
TestA1WorkAccessThroughTheHandlers
TestProjectAndTaskReadsSayNotFound
TestTableGuestBundle
TestOnlyAnAdminOpensAPrivateChannel
TestRevokingChannelMembershipTakesEffectImmediately
TestGlobalSearchFindsDocsByWhoMayReadThemNow
TestMqttAccessFollowsWhatAPersonCanRead

# Tokens and MCP reach
TestATokenActsAsAMemberOverMCP
TestPrincipalCanReachDocsAgainstRealGraph
TestAnAgentsTokenWritesDocsAsTheAgent
TestEveryPublicAPIRouteAnswers

# Chat: send and read
TestChatA0ServerAnswers
TestChatDay0ContractsAnswerAsToday
TestADMStoredIsSentEvenWhenItsReadMarksCantBeWritten
TestAConversationsReadSaysWhetherItIsThere
TestPagingNeverSkipsAMessageInTheSameSecondAsTheEdge

# Tasks: create and update
TestProjectsDay0ContractsAnswerAsToday
TestANewTaskReachesItsReadersAndWhomItIsGivenTo
TestAStaleFieldSaveKeepsTheOptionsItDoesntName

# Tables
TestTableCellEdits

# Docs: save and collaboration
TestACollabSaveIsOneUpsertThatSaysWhatChanged
TestOpeningADocIsNotEditingIt
TestDocVersionRowsKeepNamedOnes

# Restore, and the search index
TestArchivingAndRestoringADoc
TestTheBackfillFillsInTheIndexWithoutUndoingARemoval

# Storage
TestOnlyThoseWhoMayAddToADocUploadItsFiles
TestContentIOZipOfThreeFilesMakesThreeDocsWithImagesInStorage

# Calendar
TestCalendarDay0ContractsAnswerAsToday

